PN,30401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785880112
OL,3,CBreast cancer referral criteria miss
OL,4,C95% of women under 50 who are high risk
OL,6,FThe criteria given to GPs to refer
OL,7,Fwomen at risk of breast cancer for
OL,8,Ffurther tests or specialist care miss
OL,9,Fup to 95% of patients under 50 who go
OL,10,Fon to develop the disease within a
OL,11,Fdecade, new research suggests.
OL,13,FBreast cancer is one of the leading
OL,14,Fcauses of death in women under 50 in
OL,15,Fthe UK.
OL,17,FIn England, women at higher risk are
OL,18,Freferred based on family history,
OL,19,Ffollowing the criteria set by the
OL,20,FNational Institute for Health and Care
OL,21,FExcellence (Nice).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785880112
OL,3,CBreast cancer referral criteria miss
OL,4,C95% of women under 50 who are high risk
OL,6,FHowever, using a new risk assessment
OL,7,Fsystem which included lifestyle and
OL,8,Fgenetic information, researchers from
OL,9,Fthe University of Cambridge identified
OL,10,Feight times as many women in the age
OL,11,Fgroup who developed breast cancer.
OL,13,FThe tool, known as Boadicea, looked at
OL,14,Ffactors such as family history,
OL,15,Freproductive history, lifestyle and
OL,16,Fgenetics.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785880112
OL,3,CBreast cancer referral criteria miss
OL,4,C95% of women under 50 who are high risk
OL,6,FThe analysis, published in the British
OL,7,FJournal of Cancer, suggests that using
OL,8,Fthe Boadicea model for all women under
OL,9,F50 would lead to 26.5% being classed
OL,10,Fas above-population-level risk and
OL,11,Freferred for further assessment.
OL,13,FThis includes almost 35% of women
OL,14,Funder 50 who develop breast cancer
OL,15,Fwithin a decade.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, researchers found the
OL,18,Fcurrent Nice criteria would result in
OL,19,F1.4% women being referred for tests,
OL,20,Fincluding 4.4% who go on to develop
OL,21,Fbreast cancer.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785880112
OL,3,CBreast cancer referral criteria miss
OL,4,C95% of women under 50 who are high risk
OL,6,FResearchers analysed data from 1,258
OL,7,Fwomen under 50 who took part in the
OL,8,FBreast Cancer Now Generations Study
OL,9,Fbetween 2004 and 2011.
OL,11,FExperts said identifying those at the
OL,12,Fhighest risk earlier would give
OL,13,Fdoctors a better chance at treating or
OL,14,Feven preventing breast cancer.
OL,16,FDr Juliet Usher-Smith, from the
OL,17,Fdepartment of public health and
OL,18,Fprimary care at the University of
OL,19,FCambridge, said the referral criteria
OL,20,Fshould be looked at again in light of
OL,21,Fthe findings.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785880112
OL,3,CBreast cancer referral criteria miss
OL,4,C95% of women under 50 who are high risk
OL,6,F"We need to get better at identifying
OL,7,Fwomen at highest risk of breast cancer
OL,8,Fso that we can intervene early, when
OL,9,Fthere are more options for treating,
OL,10,For even preventing, their disease,"
OL,11,Fshe said.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
