FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785880112
OL,3,CBreast cancer referral criteria miss
OL,4,C95% of women under 50 who are high risk
OL,6,FDr Simon Vincent, chief scientific
OL,7,Fofficer at Breast Cancer Now, which
OL,8,Fsupported the study, said: "These
OL,9,Ffindings highlight the limitations of
OL,10,FNice's current referral criteria, and
OL,11,Fso this research must now be carefully
OL,12,Fconsidered as part of the current
OL,13,Freview of its family history
OL,14,Fguidelines."
OL,16,FHowever, Dr Vincent said it is
OL,17,F"equally important" that any changes
OL,18,Fare backed by investment so they can
OL,19,Fbe implemented fairly across the NHS.
OL,26,@pD@\OUvD@LO]yD@AOUyD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
