PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785880112
OL,3,CBreast cancer referral criteria miss
OL,4,C95% of women under 50 who are high risk
OL,6,FA Nice spokesperson said: "Nice
OL,7,Fwelcomes the findings of this study
OL,8,Fand recognises the potential of
OL,9,Fmultifactorial risk models in
OL,10,Fimproving the identification of women
OL,11,Fat increased risk of breast cancer in
OL,12,Fthe future.
OL,14,F"However, the current evidence does
OL,15,Fnot warrant a change to our existing
OL,16,Ffamilial breast cancer guideline at
OL,17,Fthis time.
OL,26,@nD@[OUvD@AOU
