CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785880112
OL,3,CBreast cancer referral criteria miss
OL,4,C95% of women under 50 who are high risk
OL,6,F"Nice remains committed to reviewing
OL,7,Fnew evidence and will consider further
OL,8,Fupdates as more data on feasibility
OL,9,Fand clinical outcomes become
OL,10,Favailable."
